  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      381.33,
      286.54,
      456.88
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, was given by me that the Government intends to acquire the following land for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      457.33,
      286.54,
      556.98
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or Servitude to be acquired: The following land lot in total extend of Hectares 0.0394 depicted in the Preliminary Plan No. Maha/6352 prepared by the Surveyor General situated at Pangollamada Grama Niladhari Division at Udagampaha Korale Minor Division in the Akurana Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Kandy District.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.019999980926514,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.16,
      557.53,
      112.37,
      568.62
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 01",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      568.72,
      286.51,
      616.8
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Tannewatte; Claimant: Pangollamada Welfare Association, Pangollamada, Akurana; Extent: 0.0394 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      1.9800000190734863,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.14,
      333.37,
      539.61,
      463.51
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land are required to appear before me personally, or by agent duly authorized in writing at Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Akurana on the 10th February, 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 10th day of February, 2015 the nature of their interests in the land and the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the aforesaid land the amount of compensation and the details of the compensation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.14,
      465.56,
      539.51,
      615.66
    ],
